    {
      "subId": "7068103",
      "subQuestName": "Talk to the adventurer",
      "sceneId": null,
      "locations": [],
      "dialogue": {
        "startDialogs": [
          "706810301"
        ],
        "dialogs": {
          "706810301": {
            "id": "706810301",
            "speakerId": 1000,
            "speakerName": "Gesine",
            "text": "Phew... Saved at last... Thank you so much!",
            "nextDialogs": [
              "706810302"
            ]
          },
          "706810302": {
            "id": "706810302",
            "speakerId": 1000,
            "speakerName": "Gesine",
            "text": "I am called Gesine. As you can see, I am an Adventurer.",
            "nextDialogs": [
              "706810303"
            ]
          },
          "706810303": {
            "id": "706810303",
            "speakerId": 1000,
            "speakerName": "Gesine",
            "text": "#Someone as skilled as you is surely no ordinary person! Are you a well-meaning knight? Or perhaps an errant {M#hero}{F#heroine}, wandering the land?",
            "nextDialogs": [
              "706810309",
              "706810306"
            ]
          },
          "706810309": {
            "id": "706810309",
            "speakerId": 1001,
            "speakerName": "Paimon",
            "text": "#Paimon's name is Paimon, and {M#he's}{F#she's} {NICKNAME}, who also happens to be a member of the Adventurers' Guild!",
            "nextDialogs": [
              "706810310"
            ]
          },
          "706810310": {
            "id": "706810310",
            "speakerId": 1000,
            "speakerName": "Gesine",
            "text": "So you are an adventurer after all, and quite the experienced one at that! You were able to dispose of such powerful monsters so easily... there really always is a bigger fish.",
            "nextDialogs": [
              "706810311"
            ]
          },
          "706810311": {
            "id": "706810311",
            "speakerId": 1000,
            "speakerName": "Gesine",
            "text": "Whereas for me... In training, I can easily remember what to do, but the second I have to do it for real, my body just doesn't listen to me...",
            "nextDialogs": [
              "706810312"
            ]
          },
          "706810312": {
            "id": "706810312",
            "speakerId": 1000,
            "speakerName": "Gesine",
            "text": "Do I really have to train for another three to five years like my teacher said? But it'll be totally humiliating if I go back empty-handed like this... *sobs*",
            "nextDialogs": [
              "706810313"
            ]
          },
          "706810313": {
            "id": "706810313",
            "speakerId": 1001,
            "speakerName": "Paimon",
            "text": "Aww, it's probably just because we have more experience! It took us a long time and a lot of battles before we got this strong!"
          },
          "706810306": {
            "id": "706810306",
            "speakerId": 1000,
            "speakerName": "Gesine",
            "text": "I understand! You must be charged with a secret mission, and must be discreet in your dealings...",
            "nextDialogs": [
              "706810307"
            ]
          },
          "706810307": {
            "id": "706810307",
            "speakerId": -1,
            "speakerName": "Player",
            "text": "Yep, that's pretty much it.",
            "nextDialogs": [
              "706810308"
            ]
          },
          "706810308": {
            "id": "706810308",
            "speakerId": 1001,
            "speakerName": "Paimon",
            "text": "Okay, that's enough with the mysterious act!"
          }
        }
      }
    },
    {
      "subId": "7068104",
      "subQuestName": "Continue forward with Gesine",
      "sceneId": null,
      "locations": [],
      "dialogue": {
        "startDialogs": [
          "706810401"
        ],
        "dialogs": {
          "706810401": {
            "id": "706810401",
            "speakerId": 1000,
            "speakerName": "Gesine",
            "text": "Sorry! Can you wait here for a moment?",
            "nextDialogs": [
              "706810402"
            ]
          },
          "706810402": {
            "id": "706810402",
            "speakerId": -1,
            "speakerName": "Player",
            "text": "What is it?",
            "nextDialogs": [
              "706810403"
            ]
          },
          "706810403": {
            "id": "706810403",
            "speakerId": 1001,
            "speakerName": "Paimon",
            "text": "Did you forget something?",
            "nextDialogs": [
              "706810404"
            ]
          },
          "706810404": {
            "id": "706810404",
            "speakerId": 1000,
            "speakerName": "Gesine",
            "text": "No, that I didn't. But looking at the map, if we go any further, we'll have left Mondstadt.",
            "nextDialogs": [
              "706810405"
            ]
          },
          "706810405": {
            "id": "706810405",
            "speakerId": 1000,
            "speakerName": "Gesine",
            "text": "And there's no way to know when I'll return... When my teacher sees my message, he'll flip his lid...",
            "nextDialogs": [
              "706810408"
            ]
          },
          "706810408": {
            "id": "706810408",
            "speakerId": 1000,
            "speakerName": "Gesine",
            "text": "Yes... When he first became an Adventurer, he ran into some Mitachurls out in the wild. During the melee, he let his guard down and got knocked out by an axe.",
            "nextDialogs": [
              "706810409"
            ]
          },
          "706810409": {
            "id": "706810409",
            "speakerId": 1000,
            "speakerName": "Gesine",
            "text": "He was lucky a passing Knight saved him and took him back.",
            "nextDialogs": [
              "706810410"
            ]
          },
          "706810410": {
            "id": "706810410",
            "speakerId": 1000,
            "speakerName": "Gesine",
            "text": "He was so ashamed, he decided to train his combat skills to the absolute max before he went out again. He's now been training for a decade...",
            "nextDialogs": [
              "706810411"
            ]
          },
          "706810411": {
            "id": "706810411",
            "speakerId": 1000,
            "speakerName": "Gesine",
            "text": "He always says the basics are the most important, but I just can't stand hacking away at wooden dummies every day!",
            "nextDialogs": [
              "706810412"
            ]
          },
          "706810412": {
            "id": "706810412",
            "speakerId": 1000,
            "speakerName": "Gesine",
            "text": "So I went out alone, without telling him..."
          }
        }
      }
    },
    {
      "subId": "7068105",
      "subQuestName": "Go to the <color=#00E1FFFF>Stone Gate</color>",
      "sceneId": null,
      "locations": [],
      "dialogue": {
        "startDialogs": [
          "706810501"
        ],
        "dialogs": {
          "706810501": {
            "id": "706810501",
            "speakerId": 1000,
            "speakerName": "Gesine",
            "text": "That's <color=#00E1FFFF>Dihua Marsh</color> up ahead, right? It's so beautiful! You won't see anything like this in Mondstadt.",
            "nextDialogs": [
              "706810502"
            ]
          },
          "706810502": {
            "id": "706810502",
            "speakerId": 1000,
            "speakerName": "Gesine",
            "text": "I knew that going on a journey was the right decision!",
            "nextDialogs": [
              "706810503"
            ]
          },
          "706810503": {
            "id": "706810503",
            "speakerId": 1000,
            "speakerName": "Gesine",
            "text": "Oh, right! This doesn't happen every day, so let's take a picture together as a keepsake!"
          }
        }
      }
    },
    {
      "subId": "7068106",
      "subQuestName": "Take a commemorative photo nearby",
      "sceneId": null,
      "locations": [],
      "dialogue": {
        "startDialogs": [],
        "dialogs": {}
      }
    },
    {
      "subId": "7068107",
      "subQuestName": "Talk to Gesine",
      "sceneId": null,
      "locations": [],
      "dialogue": {
        "startDialogs": [
          "706810701"
        ],
        "dialogs": {
          "706810701": {
            "id": "706810701",
            "speakerId": 1000,
            "speakerName": "Gesine",
            "text": "I'll treasure this photo of us together!",
            "nextDialogs": [
              "706810702"
            ]
          },
          "706810702": {
            "id": "706810702",
            "speakerId": 1000,
            "speakerName": "Gesine",
            "text": "Ah! I didn't realize how hungry I was until I relaxed...",
            "nextDialogs": [
              "706810703"
            ]
          },
          "706810703": {
            "id": "706810703",
            "speakerId": 1001,
            "speakerName": "Paimon",
            "text": "Now you mention it, Paimon's tummy is starting to rumble too...",
            "nextDialogs": [
              "706810708",
              "706810706"
            ]
          },
          "706810708": {
            "id": "706810708",
            "speakerId": 1001,
            "speakerName": "Paimon",
            "text": "Let's take a look around, find a place we can score some food!",
            "nextDialogs": [
              "706810709"
            ]
          },
          "706810709": {
            "id": "706810709",
            "speakerId": 1000,
            "speakerName": "Gesine",
            "text": "There don't seem to be any suitable restaurants nearby... Given how much you've helped and how much I look up to you, I'd feel bad eating at just any old place.",
            "nextDialogs": [
              "706810710"
            ]
          },
          "706810710": {
            "id": "706810710",
            "speakerId": 1000,
            "speakerName": "Gesine",
            "text": "Speaking of food, might that building on top of that giant rock up ahead be the famous <color=#00E1FFFF>Wangshu Inn</color>?",
            "nextDialogs": [
              "706810711"
            ]
          },
          "706810711": {
            "id": "706810711",
            "speakerId": 1000,
            "speakerName": "Gesine",
            "text": "I heard from a Liyue merchant who does business in Mondstadt that the food there is simply superb!",
            "nextDialogs": [
              "706810712"
            ]
          },
          "706810712": {
            "id": "706810712",
            "speakerId": 1000,
            "speakerName": "Gesine",
            "text": "Let me treat you to a feast as thanks!",
            "nextDialogs": [
              "706810713"
            ]
          },
          "706810713": {
            "id": "706810713",
            "speakerId": 1001,
            "speakerName": "Paimon",
            "text": "Woo-hoo! Let's go get some food!"
          },
          "706810706": {
            "id": "706810706",
            "speakerId": 1001,
            "speakerName": "Paimon",
            "text": "Hey! You can't just order Paimon around like that!",
            "nextDialogs": [
              "706810707"
            ]
          },
          "706810707": {
            "id": "706810707",
            "speakerId": 1001,
            "speakerName": "Paimon",
            "text": "Besides, it's not like you don't know what Paimon's cooking is like..."
          }
        }
      }
    },
    {
      "subId": "7068108",
      "subQuestName": "Arrive at <color=#00E1FFFF>Wangshu Inn</color>",
      "sceneId": null,
      "locations": [],
      "dialogue": {
        "startDialogs": [
          "706810801"
        ],
        "dialogs": {
          "706810801": {
            "id": "706810801",
            "speakerId": 1000,
            "speakerName": "Gesine",
            "text": "I've heard that Liyue cuisine has a holistic focus on appearance, smell, and taste! It really does look so different.",
            "nextDialogs": [
              "706810802"
            ]
          },
          "706810802": {
            "id": "706810802",
            "speakerId": 1001,
            "speakerName": "Paimon",
            "text": "And Paimon's mouth is watering just looking at it!",
            "nextDialogs": [
              "706810803"
            ]
          },
          "706810803": {
            "id": "706810803",
            "speakerId": 1002,
            "speakerName": "Black Screen",
            "text": "Together, you savor the delicacies of Wangshu Inn...",
            "nextDialogs": [
              "706810804"
            ]
          },
          "706810804": {
            "id": "706810804",
            "speakerId": 1001,
            "speakerName": "Paimon",
            "text": "Wowowow, this is delicious too, and this, and that... Ahhh, I'm too stuffed to eat another bite!",
            "nextDialogs": [
              "706810807"
            ]
          },
          "706810807": {
            "id": "706810807",
            "speakerId": 1000,
            "speakerName": "Gesine",
            "text": "Thank you so much for everything you've done! If it weren't for you, I can't imagine how much more difficult it would've been for me to get here.",
            "nextDialogs": [
              "706810808"
            ]
          },
          "706810808": {
            "id": "706810808",
            "speakerId": 1000,
            "speakerName": "Gesine",
            "text": "One of the staff here told me that if I stay on this road, <color=#00E1FFFF>Liyue Harbor</color> will be just up ahead.",
            "nextDialogs": [
              "706810809"
            ]
          },
          "706810809": {
            "id": "706810809",
            "speakerId": 1000,
            "speakerName": "Gesine",
            "text": "I plan to rest here for a few days, and ask around about where I can find legendary experts, then decide where I should go next.",
            "nextDialogs": [
              "706810810"
            ]
          },
          "706810810": {
            "id": "706810810",
            "speakerId": 1000,
            "speakerName": "Gesine",
            "text": "Though I really enjoyed traveling with you, I can't keep imposing on you like this.",
            "nextDialogs": [
              "706810811"
            ]
          },
          "706810811": {
            "id": "706810811",
            "speakerId": 1000,
            "speakerName": "Gesine",
            "text": "Moving forward, it's up to me to get stronger, so that I can become an Adventurer just as reliable as you!",
            "nextDialogs": [
              "706810812"
            ]
          },
          "706810812": {
            "id": "706810812",
            "speakerId": 1001,
            "speakerName": "Paimon",
            "text": "Hehe, though we didn't spend that much time together, we had a good time too!",
            "nextDialogs": [
              "706810813"
            ]
          },
          "706810813": {
            "id": "706810813",
            "speakerId": 1001,
            "speakerName": "Paimon",
            "text": "I hope we'll meet again sometime!"
          }
        }
      }
    },
